  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとなつっこい　せいかく。うつくしい\nさえずりと　おばねを　ふる　うごきで\nなかまに　あいずを　おくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "사람을 잘 따르는 성격이다. 아름다운\n지저귐과 꽁지를 흔드는 움직임으로\n동료에게 신호를 보낸다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Peu farouche, il communique avec ses congénères\npar un doux gazouillis et par des signaux de la queue.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ein sehr zutrauliches Pokémon. Durch Zwitschern\nund Bewegen der Schwanzfedern sendet es Signale\nan seine Gefährten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es muy amigable y se comunica con sus aliados\nmediante melodiosos gorjeos y el movimiento de su\ncola y sus gráciles alas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha una natura amichevole. Comunica con i suoi simili\ntramite meravigliosi cinguettii e movimenti delle penne\ndella coda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "These friendly Pokémon send signals\nto one another with beautiful chirps\nand tail-feather movements.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人懐っこい　性格。美しい　さえずりと\n尾羽を　振る　動きで\n仲間に　合図を　送る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es muy amigable y se comunica con sus aliados\nmediante melodiosos gorjeos y el movimiento de su\ncola y sus gráciles alas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "さえずる　こえは　うつくしいが\nなわばりに　はいった　あいては\nようしゃしない　あらあらしさだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "지저귀는 소리는 아름답지만\n영역에 들어온 상대를\n용서하지 않는 난폭한 성격이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son chant est harmonieux, mais trompeur !\nLes ennemis qui pénètrent sur son territoire se\nretrouvent confrontés à un déluge de violence.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Zwitschern ist wunderschön, aber wenn Gegner\nsein Revier betreten, kennt es keine Gnade.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su melodioso gorjeo lo dota de una gran belleza,\npero adopta una actitud agresiva y despiadada hacia\ncualquiera que ose invadir su territorio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cinguetta in modo meraviglioso, ma diventa\nestremamente aggressivo se un nemico invade\nil suo territorio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despite the beauty of its lilting voice, it’s\nmerciless to intruders that enter its territory.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "さえずる　声は　美しいが\n縄張りに　入った　相手は\n容赦しない　荒々しさだ。",
